			{" "}
			<p>{"htmx supports the "}<a href="https://htmx.org/attributes/hx-confirm/"><code>hx-confirm</code></a>{" attribute to provide a simple mechanism for confirming a user action. This uses the default "}<code>confirm()</code>{" function in javascript which, while trusty, may not be consistent with your applications UX."}</p>
