			<p>{"In this example we will see how to use "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://sweetalert2.github.io">sweetalert2</a>{" to implement a custom confirmation dialog. Below are two examples, one using a click+custom event method, and one using the built-in "}<code>hx-confirm</code>{" attribute and the "}<a href="https://htmx.org/events/#htmx:confirm"><code>htmx:confirm</code></a>{" event."}</p>
