			{" "}
			<pre data-lang="html" style="background-color:#1f2329;color:#abb2bf;" class="language-html "><code class="language-html" data-lang="html"><span>&lt;</span><span style="color:#e06c75;">{"script "}</span><span style="color:#d19a66;">src</span><span>=</span><span style="color:#98c379;">"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2&#64;11"</span><span>&gt;&lt;/</span><span style="color:#e06c75;">script</span><span>{">\n"}</span><span>&lt;</span><span style="color:#e06c75;">{"button "}</span><span style="color:#d19a66;">hx-get</span><span>=</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"\"/confirmed\" \n"}</span><span>{"        "}</span><span style="color:#d19a66;">hx-trigger</span><span>=</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"'confirmed'\n"}</span><span>{"        "}</span><span style="color:#d19a66;">onClick</span><span>=</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"\"Swal.fire({title: 'Confirm', text:'Do you want to continue?'}).then((result)=>{\n"}</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"            if(result.isConfirmed){\n"}</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"              htmx.trigger(this, 'confirmed');  \n"}</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"            } \n"}</span><span style="color:#98c379;">{"        })\""}</span><span>{">\n"}</span><span>{"  Click Me\n"}</span><span>&lt;/</span><span style="color:#e06c75;">button</span><span>{">\n"}</span></code></pre>
			{" "}
			<p>{"Here we use javascript to show a Sweet Alert 2 on a click, asking for confirmation. If the user confirms the dialog, we then trigger the request by triggering the custom “confirmed” event which is then picked up by "}<code>hx-trigger</code>.</p>
			{" "}
